@startuml
title 多人共享记账系统——类图（核心业务）
skinparam classAttributeIconSize 0
skinparam shadowing false
hide empty methods

class "用户" as User {
  - id: Long
  - username: String
  - passwordHash: String
}
class "账本" as Ledger {
  - id: Long
  - name: String
  + create()
}
class "成员关系" as Member {
  - id: Long
  - role: String
  - active: Boolean
  + invite()
  + exit()
}
class "分类" as Category {
  - name: String
  - enabled: Boolean
}
class "收支记录" as Entry {
  - id: Long
  - amountCent: Long
  - status: String
  + submit()
  + modify()
  + withdraw()
  + review(result, reason)
  + voidRecord(reason)
}
class "分摊明细" as Share {
  - amountCent: Long
}
class "月度预算" as Budget {
  - month: String
  - limitCent: Long
}
class "结算" as Settlement {
  - id: Long
  - status: String
  - memberAmounts: Map
  + generate()
  + confirm()
}
class "更正申请" as Correction {
  - correctedContent: String
  - reason: String
  - status: String
  + submit()
  + review()
}
class "调整明细" as Adjustment {
  - deltaCent: Long
}
class "操作日志" as Log {
  - operatorId: Long
  - action: String
  - time: DateTime
}

User "1" -- "0..*" Member
Ledger "1" -- "1..*" Member
Ledger "1" -- "0..*" Category
Ledger "1" -- "0..*" Entry
Ledger "1" -- "0..*" Budget
Ledger "1" -- "0..*" Settlement
Ledger "1" -- "0..*" Log
Entry "0..*" --> "1" Category
Entry "0..*" --> "1" Member : 记账人
Entry "0..*" --> "1" Member : 付款人或收款人
Entry "1" *-- "1..*" Share
Share "0..*" --> "1" Member
Settlement "0..1" -- "0..*" Entry : 固定清单
Correction "0..*" --> "1" Entry : 已结算原记录
Correction "1" *-- "0..*" Adjustment
Adjustment "0..*" --> "1" Member
Settlement "0..1" -- "0..*" Adjustment : 后续调整

note bottom of Member
  角色属于当前账本的成员关系。
  同一用户在不同账本可拥有不同角色。
end note

note bottom of Settlement
  金额按整数分保存，分摊合计等于原金额。
  memberAmounts保存成员应收应付快照。
  固定清单中的记录只能结算一次。
end note

legend bottom
  本图只展示主要字段、方法和关联，不是完整数据库结构。
  记录状态：待审核、已审核、已驳回、已撤回、已作废。
  未结算错账：作废原记录，提交关联原记录的新记录。
  已结算错账：原结果保留，通过更正申请生成调整明细。
  邀请、管理权限转让及日志完整字段在模块说明中补充。
endlegend
@enduml
